  "goodToKnow": "Wohlwollend means benevolent or favourable: etwas wohlwollend prüfen (to look at it favourably), ein wohlwollender Blick. Das Wohlwollen is goodwill. By law, a German Arbeitszeugnis (job reference) must be wohlwollend, so employers use coded phrases: stets zu unserer vollsten Zufriedenheit means very good, while zu unserer Zufriedenheit is only satisfactory."
